# Documentation

- Public modules, hooks, and repository methods get JSDoc that states the design reason (read-through cache, code-splitting, focus restoration).
- Do not comment a line that restates the identifier (`// get listing`).
- File-level banners belong on data-layer and a11y primitives; presentational components stay lean.

```ts
// ❌ BAD
/** Get listing. */
export function getListing() {}

// ✅ GOOD
/**
 * Read-through lookup: L1 Redis mock, then IndexedDB.
 * Why: listing revisits should not pay seed-decode + IDB latency twice.
 */
export function getListingById() {}
```
